{"version":4,"id":"2024-11-30-CutlerEvan-road-nks1862","time":"2024-11-30T00:38:00","utcOffsetHours":-5,"timeZone":"America/New_York","durationSeconds":420,"place":{"name":"Grove Street at Mount Hebron Road, Montclair, New Jersey","locations":[{"lat":40.8517119,"lng":-74.1944201}]},"observer":{"id":"CutlerEvan","title":"Evan Cutler"},"description":{"en":"Driving into Montclair on Grove Street at about 00:40, Evan Cutler sees \"what looks like the full Moon\" right over the horizon, which starts to move to the left and comes towards him: too big and too low to be a plane, he says. The night of Friday into Saturday 30 November, as Trailblazer reads \"Friday night\". Seen looking ahead down Grove Street: ASSUMED: ahead of him as he drove south into Montclair, where the roofs down the street leave the lowest gap.","fr":"Entrant dans Montclair par Grove Street vers 0 h 40, Evan Cutler voit « ce qui ressemble à la pleine Lune » juste au-dessus de l'horizon, qui se met à aller vers la gauche et vient vers lui : trop grand et trop bas pour un avion, dit-il. La nuit du vendredi au samedi 30 novembre, comme Trailblazer lit « vendredi soir ». Vu regardant devant lui dans Grove Street : SUPPOSÉ : devant lui alors qu'il roulait vers le sud pour entrer dans Montclair, là où les toits de la rue laissent la trouée la plus basse."},"tags":["US","NJ drone wave 2024","aircraft","misidentification"],"sources":[{"title":"Claimed sighting of large drone, Montclair, New Jersey, 29th November 2024","url":"https://www.metabunk.org/threads/claimed-sighting-of-large-drone-montclair-new-jersey-29th-november-2024.13826/","publication":{"publisher":"Metabunk","time":"2024-12-12"}},{"title":"Interview of Evan Cutler","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fLJrYbcIkiI","publication":{"publisher":"NewsNation","time":"2024-12"}},{"title":"Aircraft positions (ADS-B) of the night, globe_history releases","url":"https://github.com/adsblol","publication":{"publisher":"ADSB.lol feeders and contributors (